              {
                "type": "TEXT",
                "id": "9:16023",
                "name": "2–8 players · 1–4 rounds  One person draws. Everyone else guesses. The",
                "w": 580,
                "h": 275,
                "hSize": "hug",
                "text": "2–8 players · 1–4 rounds\n\nOne person draws. Everyone else guesses.\nThe drawer has 15 seconds to choose one of 3 private words. If time runs out, the first word is picked.\n\nGuess within 90 seconds. Letter clues appear as the clock runs down. A correct guess locks your input until the next turn.\n\nFaster guesses earn more points. The drawer gets a share of correct guesses. The answer is revealed for 10 seconds, then play moves on.",
                "textStyle": "Zumpo/Body",
                "fills": [
                  "$Zumpo · UI:color/muted"
                ],
                "autoResize": "height"
              },
