              {
                "type": "TEXT",
                "id": "9:16028",
                "name": "2–8 players · one shared board  Everybody chooses one covered cell at ",
                "w": 580,
                "h": 325,
                "hSize": "hug",
                "text": "2–8 players · one shared board\n\nEverybody chooses one covered cell at the same time. A click locks your pick immediately. Other picks stay hidden until the reveal.\n\nYou have 15 seconds to pick, then 4 seconds to see results. Safe picks score points. Mines cost points. Risk changes the reward.\n\nPick the same safe cell as someone else? You split the reward. Run out of time? A safest available cell is auto-picked, and base points are forfeited.\n\nThe host chooses Small, Medium or Large. Play ends when the board is resolved or fewer than 2 players remain.",
                "textStyle": "Zumpo/Body",
                "fills": [
                  "$Zumpo · UI:color/muted"
                ],
                "autoResize": "height"
